      "independent_calculation": "Feed SOF, 11-bit ID MSB-first, RTR/IDE/r0, DLC and data through a zero-initialized 15-bit LFSR using polynomial 0x4599; append CRC MSB-first and independently count inserted bits after runs of five equal transmitted bits through CRC. Add that count to the 44 unstuffed bits from SOF through EOF. Intermission is outside the frame."
